; 4_voice_get_ready — SSG voice approximation: "GET READY!"
;
; Three syllable bursts.  Each "syllable" is a rapid micro-glide of
; close notes (vowel formant simulation) capped with a noise burst
; (consonant simulation).  Preset 2 has aggressive tone+noise mix
; for the consonants; preset 0 is clean square for vowels.

T220
V13
O5
L64

; "G-" consonant + "ET" vowel glide   (~250 ms)
P3 D E
P0 F+ G G+ A A G F+ E

; brief gap
P3 R32

; "REA-" rapid rising vowel             (~300 ms)
P0 E F+ G A B B B B A G
P3 R64

; "-DY" descending vowel close          (~250 ms)
P0 A G F+ E D D D D
P3 R64

; "!" exclamation accent
P0 A A B B > C
~
